              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la tertulia — \"the get-together (for conversation)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Los viernes hay tertulia en el café. On Fridays there is a get-together at the café."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A regular group that meets to talk; on radio and TV, una tertulia is a panel discussion."
            }
          ]
        },
